Next, to confirm the absence of local charges, we study the spectrum of the transfer matrix of local extensive observables defined in Section~\ref{sect:trans}, which indeed shows the absence of any eigenvalues on the unit circle. To examine the absence of quasilocal charges, we then analyze the scaling of the gap in the transfer matrix spectrum, see Figure~\ref{fig:class_1_spectrum}.

