In Figure~\ref{fig:quasilocal}, we present the spectrum of the transfer matrix for this model, along with the exponential closing of the gap. In addition, we investigate the locality properties of the eigenvector corresponding to the eigenvalue closest to 1. We present the decay of partial norms of the eigenovector with the eigenvalue closest to 1 in Figure~\ref{fig:quasilocal}. This exponential decay of the partial norms affirms the quasilocal nature of the charge.

