\section{Conclusions and Future Work}
We create a method to bake 3D Gaussians for reflectance and environment mapping in Unity. We intend to integrate GBake with Unity's Universal Render Pipeline to bake cubemaps of both splats and meshes simultaneously. We would also like to revisit rasterization for faster seam-free baking and explore equirectangular projection for other spherical environment map representations.


