\item \textbf{Step 8}
Put $t=2u_3$. Then $\gamma=\frac{A+B\sqrt{d}}{C}$, where $A=G(xt+yv_3)$, $B=Gy$, $C=t$. The output is $\varphi_3=(u_3,v_3,w_3)=\frac{1}{\gamma}\varphi_1 \varphi_2$.
