\title{RepuNet: A Reputation System for Mitigating Malicious Clients in DFL}
\author{Isaac Marroqui Penalva, Enrique Tomás Martínez Beltrán, Manuel Gil Pérez, Alberto Huertas Celdrán% <-this % stops a space
