Impact has a negative relation with age but the association is very weak (coefficient $=-0.0002$ (in a 0-100 scale), p = 0.048). Productivity actually has a strong positive relation with age (coefficient = 0.007, p = 0.000). Here age is at the scientist level not the team level.


