When one of the manufacturers (say $M_j$) chooses the action $n_o$ and $M_i$ quotes price $p_i$, from \eqref{demand_function} and \eqref{eqn_util_manu}, the utility functions of the manufacturers   are given by:
\begin{eqnarray}
