\begin{abstract}
We completely characterize the topologizability and power boundedness of convolution and dual convolution operators on power series spaces. We determine necessary conditions for a Toeplitz operator to be m-topologizable, and power bounded on $\Lambda_{1}(n)$ and $\Lambda_{\infty}(n)$, and consequently on $H(\mathbb{C})$ and $H(\mathbb{D})$.
\end{abstract}

