$$|\beta^{*k}_{n-1}|\leq e^{q\alpha_{n}}$$
for every $n\in \mathbb{N}$.
Then, the dual convolution operator $\widecheck{T}_{\beta}:\Lambda_{\infty}(\alpha)\to \Lambda_{\infty}(\alpha)$ satisfies the following: 
