    \item[4.] $\widecheck{T}_{\beta}$ is Ces\'aro bounded and $\displaystyle \lim_{n\to \infty} \frac{\widecheck{T}^{\hspace{0.025in}n}_{\beta}}{n}=0,$ pointwise in $\Lambda_{1}(\alpha)$.
