We compute the Hilbert series of its arc space 
$H_{(A(\mathcal{V}_{(A_1,A_4)})_\infty}(q,t)$ using technique discussed in Section \ref{sec:comp_Hilb_ser}. Let us  order the variables in the deglex ordering:
\begin{equation}
    J_1>J_2>\cdots
